{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/iv72_J2yIVplv9itTuu2Uw","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:36.581042+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/iv72_J2yIVplv9itTuu2Uw","html":"<div><section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>学院简介</span></span></strong><strong></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>人工智能学院是在学校原计算机系的基础上发展形成的，集教学、科研于一体的研究型学院。1989年，我校创建了计算机专业，并成立计算机系，是较早在全国高校中开设的专业之一。2001年，成立计算机学院。2017年，成立人工智能学院，与计算机学院合署办公，重点支撑计算机科学与技术学科在全国第四轮学科评估进入B+档(排名10%～20%)。2025年，学校原计算机学院/人工智能学院和原先进制造学院部分系部合并组建人工智能学院（重邮科大讯飞人工智能学院）。学院拥有</span><strong><span><span>“智能科学与技术”一级学科博士学位（全国首批10所高校之一）和硕士学位授权点以及“电子信息”专业博士学位（人工智能）和专业硕士学位（人工智能、大数据技术与工程）授权点</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>学院形成了一支结构合理的高水平师资队伍，拥有</span><strong><span><span>双聘院士1人，国外院士2人，IEEE Fellow 2人，国家级高层次人才5人，国家级青年人才2人，科睿唯安“全球高被引科学家”2人，省部级人才31人</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>。</span></span></strong><span>学院教师担任了国际粗糙集学会理事长（</span><strong><span><span>华人首位</span></span></strong><span>）、中国人工智能学会副理事长（</span><strong><span><span>西部首位</span></span></strong><span>）、IEEE TPAMI编委等人工智能领域的重要学术职务。拥有国家级创新群体1个，省部级创新团队5个。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ubbPdxbSMQMcyDNVZJZEEiaJenibL7HfibKicOF6SUOmB8ibjec96LfN4CLA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9u5xiaTZ48FEqwV6tCQXBkb9alibmUkrref2UH6c8FQKkomiagWEiaUTtia6Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9up0D1fRgJo5pxQYRvPP1ecTN9vDibf4nCqEaMQCibdBfSan71DUyrb0DA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院建有“大数据智能计算”示范型国际科技合作基地、“网络空间大数据智能安全”教育部重点实验室、“旅游多源数据感知与决策技术”文化和旅游部重点实验室、“数字经济智能与安全”川渝共建实验室等多个国家级和省部级平台。承担了国家自然科学基金创新群体（人工智能领域全国第二个）、国家重点研发计划、国家自然科学基金原创探索计划项目等一批重大科研项目。持续在人工智能领域Nature子刊、TPAMI、CVPR、NIPS等顶级期刊和会议上发表高水平论文，重点支撑计算机科学与技术学科ESI学科排名位列全球前1.5‰。</span><strong><span><span>获国家级科技进步二等奖等重要科技奖励</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p><p><span>学院始终坚持</span><strong><span><span>以国家战略需求为导向</span></span></strong><span>，着力培养兼具创新能力和实践能力的高层次人才。近年来</span><strong><span><span>研究生就业率持续稳定在98%以上</span></span></strong><span>，毕业生广泛就职于人工智能算法研发、智能系统开发、软件测试等核心岗位，主要分布在互联网头部企业、金融科技、智能制造及信息技术服务等领域。学院</span><strong><span><span>2025届硕士毕业生签约就业平均年薪26.0万元、中位值24.0万元、最高值60.0万元</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9uH2XBTA7aZ3l5cul5Db7OdUo2cCfLWdBV1R2gCTRybgk5jSFSTdxfEQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9um7kxvByRsJTdUP4y2AgGp4TyAjU7fMTX7gL0VNTuIDCOPrb3ee6tUQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>夏令营安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>为促进全国各高校优秀大学生之间的交流，让更多青年学子了解重庆邮电大学人工智能学院，我院面向全国</span><strong><span><span>各高校本科三年级在校生（2026年应届本科毕业生）</span></span></strong><span>举办夏令营（</span><strong><span><span>线上</span></span></strong><span>）。本届夏令营将举办学院介绍、团队及导师介绍交流、优秀营员甄选等活动。欢迎有意保研或直博至重庆邮电大学人工智能学院继续深造的优秀大学生踊跃报名参加。</span></p><p><span>本届夏令营拟招收约200人，</span><strong><span><span>采用线上形式进行，活动日程共六天（2025年8月24日—8月29日)</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请条件</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>1. 品德优良，学风端正，身心健康，无任何考试作弊、学术不端以及其他违法违纪受处分记录。</span></p><p><span>2. 全国各高校</span><strong><span><span>本科三年级在校生</span></span></strong><span>（2026年应届本科毕业生）。</span></p><p><span>3. </span><strong><span><span>本科专业与申请专业相同或相近</span></span></strong><span>，如人工智能、智能科学与技术、数据科学与大数据技术、计算机科学与技术、机器人工程、物联网工程、软件工程、信息安全、网络空间安全、信息工程、通信工程、电子信息工程、自动化等相关专业。</span></p><p><span>4. 学习成绩优秀，</span><strong><span><span>达到所在学校推荐免试生要求且有意申请我院推荐免试硕士生或直博生，本科前3年（或前5学期）总评成绩排名在就读专业前20%之内(在科研方面有突出表现的学生可不受此约束)</span></span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请程序</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>1、</span><strong><span><span>网上报名（2025年8月20日18:00前完成报名，逾期不受理）</span></span></strong></p><p><span>申请人</span><span><strong><span>扫描以下二维码</span></strong></span><span>，按提示和要求填写相关信息（包括申请人个人信息、三个推免意向导师志愿等）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9u15ibibJibo6lvE28rXmke6V7HK7ib0mLIbrzMpjgjXXBHG5mRn3ZNh7KdA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>报名信息请务必真实、准确。凡提供虚假信息的，一经查实，即取消申请人营员资格，并保留追溯的权利。</span></p><p><span>2、我院将根据报名情况和择优原则，对申请者提交的网报信息进行审核并最终确定入选营员名单。</span></p><p><span>3、我院将在</span><span><strong><span>2025年8月21日12:00前邮件通知入选的申请人录取结果</span></strong></span><span>，申请人须于</span><span><strong><span>2025年8月22日上午12:00之前回复确认是否参加</span></strong></span><span>。未入选的申请人将不再另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>申请证明材料</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><span>1．本人有效期内的</span><span><strong><span>学生证、身份证</span></strong></span><span>扫描件；</span></p><p><span>2．本科前三学年（或前五个学期）的</span><strong><span>成绩</span></strong><strong><span>单</span></strong><span>（须加盖院系或学校教务部门公章）扫描件；</span></p><p><span>3．本人</span><span><strong><span>简历1份</span></strong></span><span>（包括学习、科技竞赛和科研情况）；</span></p><p><span>4．相关个人能力证明材料：在校期间已发表的论文、各类获奖或资格证书、国家英语四六级证书等相关材料扫描件。</span></p><p><span><strong><span>注：以上申请材料整理成一个 PDF 文件，根据学院后续通知以“本科学校+专业+姓名”命名发送至招生团队指定邮箱。</span></strong></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>日程安排</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9u1WNwbNW4Soic755ttCfBic2VCcBeE8jSeU7UKcURepWYhD8Zp3PPwOUw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>陈老师</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>电子邮箱：aiyz@cqupt.edu.cn</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>学院2026级研招官方QQ群：955313953</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>学院官网：ai.cqupt.edu.cn</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span><span>PART</span></span></strong></span><span><span>.</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>其他相关信息</span></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2025年人工智能学院院内研究生导师名录</span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9uRodLP9tJqWL7nxZhYOtS7JA55PCzg8FEQpGRghfWWiaHz29e3wvy9nw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>2026年人工智能学院研究生招生宣传册</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9uTjDxpafaWJ3864UUZ1X5xewboGTl2ibmYZFhrMxGN8nSRHY4L1AjShA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ufvLqTkL2BicyicJYibtno334UR2XgsnQ96zMTA1LBvOOW1n76eMUnQeMA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>人工智能学院团委宣传部</span></strong><strong><span>出品</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>美编 | 牟晓月</span></p><p><span>责编 | 叶   磊</span></p><p><span>指导 | 泮   凯</span></p><p><span>审核 | 张   欢</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/ibJ4rNXr318Ohia8LNLiadeLRLAqwa1Zm9ucVZvNBuf56DALE9q3MicZYibe2G7GG6dMnhIABytibBGxnrlMMguIy8RA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"b3b27fc774d884726dc412ccf08303183cb9eeedb53b8bf1d20bb4da2930a7c4","textLength":2096,"sourceSha256":"a5e660dc43bed1aa054f6ef44c7ce7010ed03e4ad2dcd834d2a23eefc9809e4f","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-60b22ce8dc52177ebf48","title":"2025年重庆邮电大学人工智能学院2025年全国优秀大学生夏令营（线上）报名通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:36.581042+00:00"}
